diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
index 7a0a09ab56..9de6ab2ad3 100644
--- a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -29,6 +29,7 @@
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- A failed automatic subagent model choice now stops the spawn. Before, a task whose agent definition or `task.agentModelOverrides` entry named a model ran on that model with a warning, so a spent judge key or a judge outage silently moved work onto a model you had not picked. The call now fails with the reason, and no child starts.
 - Fixed a lone `.` or `c` typed into a focused subagent that was still running, or waiting out a retry back-off, printing `Agent is already processing` as an error. The shortcut now queues as a steering message like any other text; the continue shortcut itself only restarts an idle agent.
 - Fixed a session wedged for days by a 429 carrying a huge retry hint, such as a 39-hour `retry-after-ms`: with `retry.waitForUsageReset` on it slept the whole wait while reporting busy, so `.` was refused and steers never landed. A wait past 24 hours now ends the retry (`auto_retry_end` with the error) and leaves the session idle. A 429 whose hint is past `retry.maxDelayMs` but is not a usage limit now blocks the failing credential until that hint and retries on a free sibling credential at once.
 
